# sshd_config — openKylin dev container (minimal, password auth enabled)
# Password is set at container startup by entrypoint.sh (DEV_PASSWORD or random).
Port 22
ListenAddress 0.0.0.0

PermitRootLogin no
PasswordAuthentication yes
KbdInteractiveAuthentication no
UsePAM no

PubkeyAuthentication yes
AuthorizedKeysFile .ssh/authorized_keys

X11Forwarding no
PrintMotd no

AcceptEnv LANG LC_*
Subsystem sftp internal-sftp
